# GitHub 技能模板

## 技能配置

```json
{
  "name": "github",
  "description": "GitHub 操作技能模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "skill": {
    "name": "github",
    "description": "Interact with GitHub using gh CLI",
    "source": "openclaw-bundled",
    "features": [
      "Issue 管理",
      "Pull Request 操作",
      "CI/CD 监控",
      "仓库操作"
    ],
    "ghCommands": {
      "issue": {
        "list": "gh issue list [flags]",
        "view": "gh issue view <number> [flags]",
        "create": "gh issue create [flags]",
        "close": "gh issue close <number>",
        "reopen": "gh issue reopen <number>"
      },
      "pr": {
        "list": "gh pr list [flags]",
        "view": "gh pr view <number> [flags]",
        "create": "gh pr create [flags]",
        "merge": "gh pr merge <number>",
        "checkout": "gh pr checkout <number>"
      },
      "run": {
        "list": "gh run list [flags]",
        "view": "gh run view <run-id> [flags]",
        "watch": "gh run watch <run-id> [flags]",
        "rerun": "gh run rerun <run-id>"
      },
      "repo": {
        "view": "gh repo view [owner/repo]",
        "clone": "gh repo clone <repo>",
        "fork": "gh repo fork <repo>"
      }
    },
    "usage": {
      "examples": [
        "列出所有 open 的 issues",
        "创建新 issue",
        "查看最近的 PR",
        "监控 CI/CD 运行"
      ]
    }
  },
  "setup": {
    "required": ["gh CLI"],
    "optional": ["GitHub OAuth token"]
  },
  "authentication": {
    "method": "gh auth login",
    "scopes": ["repo", "read:org"]
  }
}
```

## 快速使用

```bash
# 验证 gh CLI
gh --version

# 登录 GitHub
gh auth login

# 设置默认仓库
gh repo set-default owner/repo
```

## 文件位置
`templates/skills/github.json`
